WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.310
What does 1/x get close to as x grows?

00:00:05.310 --> 00:00:06.810
x = 10: 0.1

00:00:06.810 --> 00:00:10.630
x = 100: 0.01

00:00:10.630 --> 00:00:14.640
A million: 0.000001

00:00:14.640 --> 00:00:18.380
It never reaches zero, but it gets as close as you like.

00:00:18.380 --> 00:00:21.013
That target is the limit.
